        "description": "Every worker of this process with the job it runs and that job's latest step (a Riot call, a rate-limit wait, a page of a walk, …), and the jobs that finished here lately. Kept in memory by the process that runs the workers, for the last 200 jobs (DEV-19).",
        "operationId": "job_activity",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "description": "1–200 jobs in `finished`, default 50",
            "in": "query",
